    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome back to Cakey's Twisted Bakery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Cakey's Twisted Bakery as Harry, a kid trapped in a monstrous dessert factory. Sneak through eerie halls, outwit creepy bakers, and bake explosive pies to fight back. With new Fire, Ice, Acid, and Metal pies crafted from six new ingredients... You\u2019ll burn, freeze, melt, or smash obstacles and enemies. A mysterious reporter hands you a camera: snap photos of six massive baking machines to expose the bakery\u2019s secrets and escape. One wrong move, and you\u2019re toast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic pie-crafting</strong>: Unleash pies that destroy paths and foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photography thrills</strong>: Capture gear and monsters to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; chaos</strong>: Navigate a vibrant, chilling world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cakey's Twisted Bakery 2 builds on the quirky horror fans loved, with wilder mechanics and creepier vibes. Bake, snap, and escape\u2014or become dessert!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome back to Cakey's Twisted Bakery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Cakey's Twisted Bakery as Harry, a kid trapped in a monstrous dessert factory. Sneak through eerie halls, outwit creepy bakers, and bake explosive pies to fight back. With new Fire, Ice, Acid, and Metal pies crafted from six new ingredients... You\u2019ll burn, freeze, melt, or smash obstacles and enemies. A mysterious reporter hands you a camera: snap photos of six massive baking machines to expose the bakery\u2019s secrets and escape. One wrong move, and you\u2019re toast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic pie-crafting</strong>: Unleash pies that destroy paths and foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photography thrills</strong>: Capture gear and monsters to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; chaos</strong>: Navigate a vibrant, chilling world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cakey's Twisted Bakery 2 builds on the quirky horror fans loved, with wilder mechanics and creepier vibes. Bake, snap, and escape\u2014or become dessert!</p>",
